Debian packaging for the llamacpp PHP extension.

`dpkg-buildpackage` builds one module package per PHP version from
`phpquery -V` (`php8.4-llamacpp`, `php8.5-llamacpp`, …) and an empty
`php-llamacpp` package that depends on the default PHP's module.

`dh-php` installs:

  /usr/lib/php/<api>/llamacpp.so
  /etc/php/<version>/mods-available/llamacpp.ini

and the maintainer scripts call `php_invoke enmod <version> ALL llamacpp`.

Build steps are in ../BUILD.md.
